# Staging copies. The canonical ones live where they are consumed:
#   speed_model.json / scaler.json -> apps/web/public/models/  (the app loads these)
#   probes.json                    -> packages/nav-core/test/  (the test reads this)
# Committing both halves would be 420 KB of the same bytes twice, and the day
# they diverge nobody would know which one was real.
export/speed_model.json
export/scaler.json
export/probes.json
